iv class=\"_2fealp1\"><picture><source media=\"(max-width: 360px) and (min-resolution: 2dppx)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=720,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/ee3b254b-fb5c-498d-9af4-7ef88f84cfe9/unnamed.png?t=1754273986 2x\"><source media=\"(max-width: 360px)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=360,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/ee3b254b-fb5c-498d-9af4-7ef88f84cfe9/unnamed.png?t=1754273986 1x\"><source media=\"(max-width: 430px) and (min-resolution: 2dppx)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=860,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/ee3b254b-fb5c-498d-9af4-7ef88f84cfe9/unnamed.png?t=1754273986 2x\"><source media=\"(max-width: 430px)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=430,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/ee3b254b-fb5c-498d-9af4-7ef88f84cfe9/unnamed.png?t=1754273986 1x\"><img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/ee3b254b-fb5c-498d-9af4-7ef88f84cfe9/unnamed.png?t=1754273986\" alt=\"\" width=\"1600\" height=\"611\" style=\"width:100%;border-radius:0px;aspect-ratio:1600 / 611;height:auto\" class=\"_2fealp2 _2fealp5\"></picture></div></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">¿Recuerdas que te ofrecimos acceso exclusivo, actividades únicas y oportunidades para entrar al mundo cripto?</span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:700;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:16px\"><strong>¡Tu momento ha llegado! </strong></span></span><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">🔥</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Nuestros aliados en </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:700;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:16px\"><strong>Stellar</strong></span></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> y los embajadores de </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:700;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:16px\"><strong>Tellus Cooperative, WomenBiz</strong></span></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">, y nosotros en </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"http://www.tipper.lat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\">TIPPER</a></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> te invitamos a formar parte del </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:700;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:16px\"><strong>Ideatón 2025</strong></span></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">:</span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Una experiencia única donde tus ideas pueden abrirte las puertas del ecosistema cripto… y premiarte en el camino.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">🎯</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:700;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:16px\"><strong>Tu momento es ahora. Participa. Crea. Gana.</strong></span></span></p></div><div class=\"p-4\"><div class=\"mx-auto\" style=\"max-width:520px\"><div class=\"relative w-full h-0\" style=\"padding-bottom:56.25%\"><iframe class=\"absolute top-0 left-0\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" src=\"https://youtube.com/embed/6oAZ9YO98z8\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" title=\"Youtube embed\"></iframe></div></div></div><div id=\"qu-es-el-ideatn-2025-y-cmo-particip\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:700;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:16px\"><strong>¿Qué es el Ideatón 2025 y cómo participar?</strong></span></span></h3></div><div id=\"el-ideatn-2025-es-una-competencia-p\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h4 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx5\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"color:#0e0e11;font-family:inherit;font-weight:400;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:16px\">El Ideatón 2025 es una competencia previa a la conferencia Meridian de Stellar, dirigida a builders, creadores de contenido y estudiantes universitarios de LATAM. Puedes ganar hasta $2,000 USDC presentando ideas en tres categorías:</span></span></h4></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"color:#0e0e11;font-family:inherit;font-weight:700;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:16px\"><strong>Track Abierto:</strong></span></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"color:#0e0e11;font-family:inherit;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:16px\"> Para emprendedores, diseñadores o tecnólogos. Se buscan soluciones con impacto en Stellar/Soroban (prototipos o MVPs).</span></span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"color:#0e0e11;font-family:inherit;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:16px\"> 🏆 Premio mayor de $2,000 USDC.</span></span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"color:#0e0e11;font-family:inherit;font-weight:700;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:16px\"><strong>Track de Contenido: </strong></span></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"color:#0e0e11;font-family:inherit;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:16px\">Para creadores que expliquen o promuevan Stellar y DeFi en LATAM.</span></span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"color:#0e0e11;font-family:inherit;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:16px\"> 🏆 10 premios de $100 USDC.</span></span><br></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"color:#0e0e11;font-family:inherit;font-weight:700;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:16px\"><strong>Track Universitario: </strong></span></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"color:#0e0e11;font-family:inherit;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:16px\">Igual al track abierto, pero exclusivo para estudiantes con ideas que conecten Stellar con problemas reales de su comunidad.</span></span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"color:#0e0e11;font-family:inherit;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:16px\"> 🏆 2 premios de $500 USDC.</span></span></p></div></li></ul></div><div id=\"cmo-participar-en-el-track-abierto\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:700;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:16px\"><strong>¿Cómo participar en el Track Abierto?</strong></span></span></h3></div><div class=\"vl18bi0\"><ol class=\"vl18bi1\" translations=\"[object Object]\" start=\"1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"color:#0e0e11;font-family:inherit;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:16px\">Regístrate en este track</span></span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"color:#0e0e11;font-family:inherit;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:16px\">Prepara tu pitch escrito (1 página máx.)</span></span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"color:#0e0e11;font-family:inherit;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:16px\">Graba un video de 2 minutos explicando tu propuesta</span></span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"color:#0e0e11;font-family:inherit;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:16px\">Entrega tu prototipo, mockup o demo</span></span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"color:#0e0e11;font-family:inherit;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:16px\">Entrega final con formulario y enlaces</span></span></p></div></li></ol></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"color:#0e0e11;font-family:inherit;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:16px\">➡️ Todos los proyectos deben usar Stellar o Soroban de forma explícita.</span></span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"color:#0e0e11;font-family:inherit;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:16px\">➡️ No es necesario saber programar.</span></span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"color:#0e0e11;font-family:inherit;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:16px\">➡️ Se permiten equipos interdisciplinarios (máx 5 personas).</span></span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:700;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:16px\"><strong>Para conocer los otros tracks puedes ver más información en esta página: </strong></span></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://dorahacks.io/hackathon/telluscoop-ideaton/detail\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\">https://dorahacks.io/hackathon/telluscoop-ideaton/detail</a></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:700;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:16px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p></div><div id=\"quieres-ms-detalles\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:700;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:16px\"><strong>¿Quieres más detalles?</strong></span></span></h3></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">📅</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Estaremos realizando </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:700;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:16px\"><strong>Spaces en X/Twitter</strong></span></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> el próximo </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:700;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:16px\"><strong>martes 5 de agosto</strong></span></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> a las 5:00 p.m. para responder todas tus dudas.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">&nbsp;Compartiremos la dirección del spaces en las cuentas de X de </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://x.com/TellusCoop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\">@TellusCoop</a></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">, </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://x.com/Stellar_Chile\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\">@Stellar_Chile</a></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> y @</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://x.com/tipper_Lat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\">Tipper_lat </a></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">este Lunes 4 de Agosto.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:700;--font-size:100%;--mobile-